<title>USA: Most Texas Utilities preferred tendered.</title>
<headline>Most Texas Utilities preferred tendered.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Utilities Co said 71 percent of Texas Utilities Electric Co's preferred stock and depositary shares sought in the offer to purchase which expired March 21 were tendered.</p>
<p>The settlement date is expected to be March 27.</p>
<p>The company also said 56.7 percent of the outstanding $2.05 Depositary shares, 21.2 percent of the outstanding $1.875 Depositary Shares Series A, and 26.7 percent of the $1.805 Depositary Shares Series B were tendered in response to the offer.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
